      "desc:8": "§6Machine type: §aModularized Machine - Assembly Line / Component Assembly Line / Assembler / Precise Assembler§r\n\nThere is no evil, only ignorance.\nThe advanced version of Indistinct Tentacle.\nDirectly use the energy from the wireless EU network, no energy hatch required.\nInstalling module hatches near the controller block can significantly improve machine performance.\n\n[note]Hatches[/note]: Input Bus, Input Hatch, Output Bus, Output Hatch\n[note]Structure[/note]: Tiered glass (limits the energy hatch tier); Component Assembly Line Casings (tier limits recipes); the casings in the optional task.\nUse a Hologram Projector (or the NEI structure preview) to see and auto-build the structure.\n\n[note]Controller recipe[/note]: TST Assembly Line (no research needed), MAX\n - 64x MHDCSM Frame Box\n - Perfect Execution Core\n - 16x Indistinct Tentacle\n - 64x Advanced High Power Coil Block\n - 16,384x Energised Tesseract\n - 512x Stellar Construction Frame Material\n - 512x Dyson Sphere Frame Component\n - 512x Annihilation Constrainer\n - 1,024x UXV Circuit\n - 1,024x EM Ultimate Containment Advanced\n - 2,000,000,000 L UU Matter\n - 75,497,472 L Molten Eternity\n - 75,497,472 L Molten Universium\n - 75,497,472 L Molten Space Time",
